//JS

function pronic(num) {

    for (let i = 0; i <= num; i++) {

        if (i * (i + 1) == num) {
            return true;
        }

    }

    return false;
}

console.log(pronic(6));
console.log(pronic(110));
console.log(pronic(200));


//OZIM UCHUN

Pronic Number → Pronic son

Consecutive Numbers → Ketma-ket sonlar

Formula:

n × (n + 1)

Misollar:

2 × 3 = 6 ✅

10 × 11 = 110 ✅

13 × 14 = 182

14 × 15 = 210

